    "body": "## Summary\n- Removed the Rust-side log filtering/rewrite logic and restored direct `EnvFilter` initialization from `RUST_LOG` or `TRANSPONDER_LOGGING_LEVEL`\n- Kept the event receipt log concise with `event_id`, while leaving the rest of the application logging changes in place\n- Updated the deployment examples and docs to set the desired server-side `RUST_LOG` values explicitly for Transponder and its dependencies\n\n## Testing\n- `cargo fmt`\n- `cargo test`\n- `cargo clippy -- -D warnings`\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated deployment guides and development setup instructions with improved logging configuration examples.\n  * Enhanced environment variable documentation for production deployments.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Refined logging configuration to use module-level control for granular visibility into specific components.\n  * Adjusted log levels across services to reduce noise and improve message clarity.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/marmot-protocol/transponder/pull/58)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
